WEBVTT

1
00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:47.625
In the previous verse,

2
00:00:47.625 --> 00:00:50.666
Lord Krishna explained to
 us the importance of faith.

3
00:00:50.666 --> 00:00:55.708
Now in these verses, Lord Krishna
 reveals His divine nature –

4
00:00:55.708 --> 00:01:00.125
how the entire creation rests upon Him,

5
00:01:00.125 --> 00:01:03.333
yet He remains completely free from it.

6
00:01:03.333 --> 00:01:07.500
He governs this world through 
His divine power, yet

7
00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:10.916
He is bound by nothing.

8
00:01:10.916 --> 00:01:13.791
These verses explain in detail 
Lord Krishna’s

9
00:01:13.791 --> 00:01:17.541
extraordinary yogic power.

10
00:01:17.541 --> 00:01:20.041
Let us understand this.

11
00:01:24.875 --> 00:01:27.750
‘All of creation rests in Me,

12
00:01:27.750 --> 00:01:30.833
yet I am not limited by anything!’

13
00:01:30.833 --> 00:01:32.250
Lord Krishna

14
00:01:32.250 --> 00:01:33.208
is revealing His divine

15
00:01:33.208 --> 00:01:35.208
secret in these verses.

16
00:01:35.208 --> 00:01:37.458
But how is this possible?

17
00:01:37.458 --> 00:01:39.833
If everything rests in Him,

18
00:01:39.833 --> 00:01:43.833
how is He still free from all bondage?

19
00:01:43.833 --> 00:01:45.083
In reality,

20
00:01:45.083 --> 00:01:47.666
this is his, ‘yogam aishwaram’ –

21
00:01:47.666 --> 00:01:50.000
that’s his divine power and play.

22
00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:52.041
It is beyond our logic

23
00:01:52.041 --> 00:01:54.958
and can only be understood through devotion.

24
00:01:54.958 --> 00:01:56.208
Lord Krishna

25
00:01:56.208 --> 00:01:58.791
pervades every particle of creation,

26
00:01:58.791 --> 00:02:02.041
yet He is also beyond it.

27
00:02:02.041 --> 00:02:03.708
He governs the entire

28
00:02:03.708 --> 00:02:06.291
universe effortlessly,

29
00:02:06.291 --> 00:02:09.083
yet remains untouched by it.

30
00:02:09.083 --> 00:02:12.541
Just as the sky holds countless clouds

31
00:02:12.541 --> 00:02:15.583
but is never drenched by rain.

32
00:02:15.583 --> 00:02:18.958
Just as a thread holds an entire garland together

33
00:02:18.958 --> 00:02:21.708
but is never seen.

34
00:02:21.708 --> 00:02:24.833
In the same way, Lord Krishna
 is the foundation of all creation,

35
00:02:24.833 --> 00:02:28.583
yet bound by none of it.

36
00:02:28.583 --> 00:02:29.750
His existence is

37
00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:31.041
‘avyakta-murti’ –

38
00:02:31.041 --> 00:02:33.291
an unseen form.

39
00:02:33.291 --> 00:02:34.500
Even if we

40
00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:36.750
cannot perceive Him through
 our material senses,

41
00:02:36.750 --> 00:02:39.250
He is everywhere –

42
00:02:39.250 --> 00:02:41.875
and yet dependent on nothing.

43
00:02:41.875 --> 00:02:42.791
Lord Krishna

44
00:02:42.791 --> 00:02:45.750
sustains and moves creation,

45
00:02:45.750 --> 00:02:48.875
yet remains untouched by it.

46
00:02:48.875 --> 00:02:50.000
He is a king

47
00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:52.500
who desires no throne.

48
00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:53.666
A ruler

49
00:02:53.666 --> 00:02:57.250
free from the burden of ruling.

50
00:02:57.250 --> 00:02:59.458
Then in verse 9.5,

51
00:02:59.458 --> 00:03:02.666
Lord Krishna says –

52
00:03:02.666 --> 00:03:05.458
‘Although all of creation depends on Me,

53
00:03:05.458 --> 00:03:09.333
I am completely free from it!’

54
00:03:09.333 --> 00:03:10.791
This may seem

55
00:03:10.791 --> 00:03:13.041
like a contradiction.

56
00:03:13.041 --> 00:03:15.625
But this is precisely His divinity.

57
00:03:15.625 --> 00:03:18.250
Understand it with an example –

58
00:03:18.250 --> 00:03:20.500
a king governs

59
00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:22.458
a vast kingdom,

60
00:03:22.458 --> 00:03:23.500
yet does not need

61
00:03:23.500 --> 00:03:26.458
to be personally present in every corner of it.

62
00:03:26.458 --> 00:03:28.125
His power and order

63
00:03:28.125 --> 00:03:30.291
run the entire realm.

64
00:03:30.291 --> 00:03:31.541
In the same way,

65
00:03:31.541 --> 00:03:33.083
Lord Krishna nourishes

66
00:03:33.083 --> 00:03:36.875
and governs the entire universe,

67
00:03:36.875 --> 00:03:39.125
yet is untouched

68
00:03:39.125 --> 00:03:41.041
by any of its activities.

69
00:03:41.041 --> 00:03:43.958
This is the divine nature of Lord Krishna

70
00:03:43.958 --> 00:03:48.708
He governs the universe, yet
 remains beyond it Himself.

71
00:03:48.708 --> 00:03:51.250
This divine mystery cannot be understood

72
00:03:51.250 --> 00:03:54.666
through human intellect or argument alone.

73
00:03:54.666 --> 00:03:58.250
There is only one way to understand it –

74
00:03:58.250 --> 00:04:01.333
the path of faith and devotion.

75
00:04:01.333 --> 00:04:06.958
When the mind is free from
 debate and filled with love,

76
00:04:06.958 --> 00:04:10.375
this mystery reveals itself from within.

77
00:04:10.375 --> 00:04:12.625
So it does not need to be known –

78
00:04:12.625 --> 00:04:15.333
it needs to be experienced.

79
00:04:15.333 --> 00:04:17.833
Know Lord Krishna through the heart,

80
00:04:17.833 --> 00:04:20.958
and His divinity and love

81
00:04:20.958 --> 00:04:23.666
will reveal themselves in your life too.

82
00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:34.041
Sometimes in life, situations arise

83
00:04:34.041 --> 00:04:38.958
whose answers are beyond your understanding.

84
00:04:38.958 --> 00:04:42.833
When something goes in your favour,

85
00:04:42.833 --> 00:04:46.541
you call it luck.

86
00:04:46.541 --> 00:04:49.458
But when you get stuck

87
00:04:49.458 --> 00:04:52.708
in a difficult situation,

88
00:04:52.708 --> 00:04:56.125
you begin to resist it.

89
00:04:56.125 --> 00:05:00.625
You think – why did this happen to me?

90
00:05:00.625 --> 00:05:06.250
But have you ever asked yourself –

91
00:05:06.250 --> 00:05:07.791
‘What has this situation

92
00:05:07.791 --> 00:05:10.916
come to teach me?’

93
00:05:10.916 --> 00:05:15.375
Life is like a mystery.

94
00:05:15.375 --> 00:05:18.708
When you look at one piece at a time,

95
00:05:18.708 --> 00:05:21.833
it seems meaningless.

96
00:05:21.833 --> 00:05:24.458
But as time passes

97
00:05:24.458 --> 00:05:27.541
and the full picture appears before you,

98
00:05:27.541 --> 00:05:30.208
you realise

99
00:05:30.208 --> 00:05:31.833
that every piece

100
00:05:31.833 --> 00:05:35.500
was part of a greater plan.

101
00:05:35.500 --> 00:05:37.458
So if a situation

102
00:05:37.458 --> 00:05:40.375
or event unsettles you,

103
00:05:40.375 --> 00:05:46.208
instead of resisting or running from it – pause,

104
00:05:46.208 --> 00:05:48.500
and ask with humility –

105
00:05:48.500 --> 00:05:53.375
‘What has this situation come to teach me?’

106
00:05:53.375 --> 00:05:56.500
When you think in this direction,

107
00:05:56.500 --> 00:05:59.833
it brings clarity

108
00:05:59.833 --> 00:06:02.125
and peace into your life.

109
00:06:02.125 --> 00:06:03.958
Just as

110
00:06:03.958 --> 00:06:08.750
faith and humility are needed

111
00:06:08.750 --> 00:06:10.916
to understand My divine nature,

112
00:06:10.916 --> 00:06:12.416
Same way,

113
00:06:12.416 --> 00:06:15.541
patience and humility are needed

114
00:06:15.541 --> 00:06:19.333
to understand life’s situations too.

115
00:06:19.333 --> 00:06:23.250
What is beyond your understanding right now

116
00:06:23.250 --> 00:06:27.416
is not necessarily without purpose.

117
00:06:27.416 --> 00:06:33.625
Let go of ego, embrace humility,

118
00:06:33.625 --> 00:06:38.000
and allow the mysteries that are unclear today

119
00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:41.750
to unfold on their own with time.

120
00:06:46.166 --> 00:06:49.916
Differences of opinion among family members

121
00:06:49.916 --> 00:06:53.125
are very natural.

122
00:06:53.125 --> 00:06:57.208
It is possible that one member’s perspective

123
00:06:57.208 --> 00:07:00.500
does not match another’s.

124
00:07:00.500 --> 00:07:02.541
The question is not

125
00:07:02.541 --> 00:07:07.291
who is right and who is wrong.

126
00:07:07.291 --> 00:07:10.208
The question is –

127
00:07:10.208 --> 00:07:13.750
do you remain fixed only on your own view,

128
00:07:13.750 --> 00:07:15.708
or do you try to understand

129
00:07:15.708 --> 00:07:16.958
the thoughts

130
00:07:16.958 --> 00:07:19.458
and feelings of others?

131
00:07:19.458 --> 00:07:21.000
Look,

132
00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:24.333
A family runs on balance

133
00:07:24.333 --> 00:07:29.208
between different views and emotions.

134
00:07:29.208 --> 00:07:30.833
Remember –

135
00:07:30.833 --> 00:07:33.208
within every contradiction,

136
00:07:33.208 --> 00:07:37.708
there is always some complementary wisdom.

137
00:07:37.708 --> 00:07:39.958
And a family blooms through

138
00:07:39.958 --> 00:07:42.375
these very differences.

139
00:07:42.375 --> 00:07:46.166
Parents may feel children need discipline,

140
00:07:46.166 --> 00:07:50.458
while children long for freedom.

141
00:07:50.458 --> 00:07:52.875
The answer to this contradiction

142
00:07:52.875 --> 00:07:54.583
can only be

143
00:07:54.583 --> 00:07:57.416
guidance and mutual balance.

144
00:07:57.416 --> 00:08:00.000
When there is balance in relationships,

145
00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:02.541
they become stronger.

146
00:08:02.541 --> 00:08:05.958
If you look at every decision as

147
00:08:05.958 --> 00:08:09.250
‘either my way or yours,’

148
00:08:09.250 --> 00:08:12.166
relationships will begin to break.

149
00:08:12.166 --> 00:08:15.208
But if you adopt the view

150
00:08:15.208 --> 00:08:18.625
of ‘both can be right,’

151
00:08:18.625 --> 00:08:22.500
new energy and warmth

152
00:08:22.500 --> 00:08:23.958
will arise in your relationships.

153
00:08:23.958 --> 00:08:26.458
Make family decisions

154
00:08:26.458 --> 00:08:28.541
by understanding the views

155
00:08:28.541 --> 00:08:30.750
and feelings of all members,

156
00:08:30.750 --> 00:08:34.125
and maintain harmony within the family.

157
00:08:34.125 --> 00:08:37.791
Remember – opposing views can complement

158
00:08:37.791 --> 00:08:42.000
each other rather than clash.

159
00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:43.916
When you respect

160
00:08:43.916 --> 00:08:45.750
and try to understand

161
00:08:45.750 --> 00:08:48.833
each other’s perspectives,

162
00:08:48.833 --> 00:08:52.208
a harmony will arise in the family

163
00:08:52.208 --> 00:08:56.750
that honours every member’s role.

164
00:08:56.750 --> 00:08:59.333
And when everyone in the family

165
00:08:59.333 --> 00:09:02.833
respects each other’s perspective,

166
00:09:02.833 --> 00:09:07.458
love and harmony remain.

167
00:09:07.458 --> 00:09:10.041
Think about it.

168
00:09:14.250 --> 00:09:19.833
Do different views and 
strategies at the workplace

169
00:09:19.833 --> 00:09:24.833
create stress and unrest within you?

170
00:09:24.833 --> 00:09:26.166
In the professional world,

171
00:09:26.166 --> 00:09:27.750
different perspectives

172
00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:30.000
work alongside each other, 

173
00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:32.208
and this can sometimes

174
00:09:32.208 --> 00:09:36.083
create an environment of conflict.

175
00:09:36.083 --> 00:09:38.625
Now you must be thinking,

176
00:09:38.625 --> 00:09:42.875
What should we do to avoid this?

177
00:09:42.875 --> 00:09:46.541
To avoid this,

178
00:09:46.541 --> 00:09:49.500
adopt the ‘and’ perspective in your life.

179
00:09:49.500 --> 00:09:52.083
This approach teaches you

180
00:09:52.083 --> 00:09:53.833
that different ideas,

181
00:09:53.833 --> 00:09:55.208
when combined,

182
00:09:55.208 --> 00:09:58.083
can achieve great things together.

183
00:09:58.083 --> 00:10:00.416
For example –

184
00:10:00.416 --> 00:10:01.916
if a leader wants

185
00:10:01.916 --> 00:10:03.458
to bring new thinking

186
00:10:03.458 --> 00:10:04.958
into the organisation,

187
00:10:04.958 --> 00:10:07.416
while some members want

188
00:10:07.416 --> 00:10:10.791
to maintain stability –

189
00:10:10.791 --> 00:10:12.375
these two perspectives

190
00:10:12.375 --> 00:10:16.208
don’t align. And this can become a cause

191
00:10:16.208 --> 00:10:18.166
of resentment

192
00:10:18.166 --> 00:10:21.083
and conflict within the team.

193
00:10:21.083 --> 00:10:22.958
But

194
00:10:22.958 --> 00:10:24.791
if both sides come together,

195
00:10:24.791 --> 00:10:28.000
find a balance through mutual cooperation,

196
00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:29.000
and try

197
00:10:29.000 --> 00:10:30.833
to combine both

198
00:10:30.833 --> 00:10:33.083
perspectives,

199
00:10:33.083 --> 00:10:37.166
the organisation can move 
forward on the path of success.

200
00:10:37.166 --> 00:10:39.750
These different viewpoints

201
00:10:39.750 --> 00:10:42.916
are not obstacles to your progress but,

202
00:10:42.916 --> 00:10:44.375
They are opportunities

203
00:10:44.375 --> 00:10:45.458
to learn

204
00:10:45.458 --> 00:10:48.750
and keep moving forward.

205
00:10:48.750 --> 00:10:50.958
When you encounter

206
00:10:50.958 --> 00:10:54.375
different views, ask yourself –

207
00:10:54.375 --> 00:10:56.458
‘How can I combine these perspectives

208
00:10:56.458 --> 00:11:00.625
to achieve even better results?’

209
00:11:00.625 --> 00:11:04.083
When you resolve differences

210
00:11:04.083 --> 00:11:06.250
through dialogue and respect,

211
00:11:06.250 --> 00:11:07.708
and encourage fresh thinking

212
00:11:07.708 --> 00:11:11.375
and a spirit of cooperation,

213
00:11:11.375 --> 00:11:14.000
both your energy and the organisation’s

214
00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:17.125
will only enhance the quality of your work –

215
00:11:17.125 --> 00:11:20.708
just as My energy sustains

216
00:11:20.708 --> 00:11:25.958
the entire universe without obstruction.
